      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start but honestly i think the impact score is going to be a bit low on this one. it's a little too plain for the engine to register it as \"high impact.\" \n\ncan you try another version? maybe try to weave in those more powerful, descriptive words a bit more effectively. just please keep it professional—I don't want it to look like a bunch of buzzwords thrown together. it needs to feel like a high-stakes, important email, not a spam bot. can we get that score up a bit without losing the credibility?",
